  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-13T00:38:04Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Fix: replace the anyhow string errors at task.rs:289-301 and :404-410 with structured AtmErrorCode::TaskNotFound, matching the crate's existing error convention. Routed to solar on BB6-FIX-CLI-QA1-1789270000, branch fix/bb6-cli-qa1 cut from 4b0f6661c. Fixed by solar's second commit (catalog-backed TaskNotFound/TaskNotCounterparty + per-command JSON code tests), pushed to fix/bb6-cli-qa1 @ 8086e5362 (2026-09-13T00:45:06Z, per fenix). Fixed-pending-QA. BB6-FIX-CLI-QA1-1789270000 complete and self-validated by solar (2026-09-13T01:10:38Z) at fix/bb6-cli-qa1 final head adda7e3f9, parent 3aa1954e8 (BB6 L4 final); closing-triage tasklist confirms implementation commit 8086e536. Fixed-pending-QA at adda7e3f9." ;
